266
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:51,830
Let her!

267
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:54,136
Just who are you fighting for anyway?

268
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:55,790
What?

269
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:59,477
As a leader of our army, you
can't afford to show mercy!

270
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:01,120
Shut up, old man!

271
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:04,080
You're not my master anymore, so cram it!

272
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:07,300
Hey, stop!

273
00:18:08,120 --> 00:18:10,860
To be useful, even in death.

274
00:18:11,260 --> 00:18:13,660
This is all that I've ever wanted.

275
00:18:15,940 --> 00:18:17,660
Why did you have a child?

276
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:22,259
She won't contribute a damned thing,
but she'll eat plenty, I'm sure.

277
00:18:22,660 --> 00:18:24,542
We have too many mouths to feed.

278
00:18:24,900 --> 00:18:27,547
Take her to the mountain
and leave her there.

279
00:18:28,660 --> 00:18:30,700
Mommy, where are we going?

280
00:18:31,740 --> 00:18:35,040
Mommy, don't leave me here, please! No!

281
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:39,940
No, Mommy, take me with me!

282
00:18:40,060 --> 00:18:41,420
This place is scary!

283
00:18:43,180 --> 00:18:45,580
I'm leaving you because you're useless.

284
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:48,920
You're not wanted or needed, okay?

285
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:54,040
Not by this world, and
not by anyone in it.

286
00:18:55,820 --> 00:18:56,940
Even you?

287
00:18:58,200 --> 00:19:00,660
Even you don't need me, Mommy.

288
00:19:02,740 --> 00:19:04,480
You were wrong, Mother.

289
00:19:05,260 --> 00:19:07,220
Now someone does need me.

290
00:19:07,940 --> 00:19:10,400
I said stop, you stupid broad!

291
00:19:10,760 --> 00:19:12,407
You're the one who's stupid!

292
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:13,740
What the...

293
00:19:15,080 --> 00:19:16,460
He's a monster!

294
00:19:17,540 --> 00:19:19,380
Look up there!

295
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:23,060
Damn you, Sai!

296
00:19:23,420 --> 00:19:26,240
You're a disgrace to the Hapasui army!

297
00:19:27,620 --> 00:19:31,444
Either correct your actions or
resign from your post immediately.

298
00:19:33,060 --> 00:19:34,957
This is my problem.

299
00:19:35,040 --> 00:19:37,620
So stay out of it, old man.

300
00:19:38,320 --> 00:19:39,960
Like hell I will.

301
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,997
I sure can't check it.

302
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:46,017
This is scary.

303
00:19:46,100 --> 00:19:48,800
His headbutt can split a glacier in half.

304
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:51,857
I'll set you straight with my drill head.

305
00:19:51,940 --> 00:19:53,717
And that goes for the both of you.

306
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:55,540
Drill Drago.

307
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:01,660
Who shall get healed?

308
00:20:18,460 --> 00:20:20,780
I finally found my place.

309
00:20:21,060 --> 00:20:23,200
This is all I could ask for.

310
00:20:27,020 --> 00:20:29,740
You need to value your
life more than that!

311
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,960
I don't understand.

312
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:03,180
Why did you stop me?

313
00:21:04,080 --> 00:21:05,320
Let me die!

314
00:21:05,840 --> 00:21:08,134
Isn't that the only way I can help you?

315
00:21:08,780 --> 00:21:13,480
If I die, I can finally be
useful to someone, can't I?

316
00:21:14,080 --> 00:21:14,960
Poor girl.

317
00:21:15,620 --> 00:21:17,720
The world you live in is twisted.

318
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:20,100
They taught you all wrong.

319
00:21:29,840 --> 00:21:33,320
Don Chin-Jow's famous drill
head is bent sideways!

320
00:21:33,960 --> 00:21:35,840
I can't believe I did that!

321
00:21:36,380 --> 00:21:38,760
My attack was that powerful?

322
00:21:39,680 --> 00:21:40,960
You're surprised.

323
00:21:41,420 --> 00:21:45,040
You're not the one whose head
is bent at a 90 degree angle.

324
00:21:45,540 --> 00:21:47,777
They're gonna fight to
the death, aren't they?

325
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:51,100
Your power has awakened
and your form is true.

326
00:21:51,780 --> 00:21:54,309
Though your training
was filled with blood,

327
00:21:54,460 --> 00:21:57,560
sweat and tears, it
has indeed borne fruit.

328
00:21:57,800 --> 00:21:58,917
Grabs, I...

329
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:00,460
I'm so proud of you.

330
00:22:00,780 --> 00:22:04,160
The Hoshokan technique has
finally found its true heir.

331
00:22:06,180 --> 00:22:12,900
Sai, your kick shall inherit the title
Drill Dragon Nail as my head did before it.

332
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:17,340
Having witnessed its strength,

333
00:22:17,600 --> 00:22:21,424
I may rest easy, knowing that you
can split the Continent of Ice.

334
00:22:22,080 --> 00:22:24,277
The Hapa Sui army is yours.

335
00:22:24,360 --> 00:22:29,517
Truly and completely now, I shall
cancel your arranged marriage.

336
00:22:29,600 --> 00:22:33,177
Your life is yours to live as you please.

337
00:22:33,260 --> 00:22:38,837
To be frank, my chronic pain has been
acting up since the battle with Straw Hat,

338
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:42,096
and I haven't been able to
fight to my true potential.

339
00:22:42,380 --> 00:22:43,777
I'm no spring chicken.

340
00:22:43,860 --> 00:22:47,837
I had started to worry,
but now I know my legacy.

341
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:49,280
YAAAHHHHH!

342
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:50,790
Ohhhh!

343
00:22:51,500 --> 00:22:53,380
Behold, the Seal of Chi!

344
00:22:54,160 --> 00:22:54,990
Ta-da-da!

345
00:22:56,680 --> 00:22:57,510
Ahhhh!

346
00:22:58,020 --> 00:22:59,120
Graf! No!

347
00:22:59,580 --> 00:23:00,620
A perfect Chi!

348
00:23:10,280 --> 00:23:11,110
Mh!

349
00:23:11,193 --> 00:23:14,240
He took down Don Chin-Jow with one shot!

350
00:23:14,780 --> 00:23:16,280
Ha ha ha ha ha!

351
00:23:17,820 --> 00:23:18,650
Ah!

352
00:23:18,733 --> 00:23:21,720
Geo-fist, ultimate technique,
battle insurance fist!

353
00:23:23,120 --> 00:23:27,660
A safety precaution to
counteract infirmary or old age.

354
00:23:27,920 --> 00:23:30,660
By performing Ji Gong exercises,

355
00:23:30,940 --> 00:23:34,540
you can store away muscle from
your prime to draw upon later.

356
00:23:34,820 --> 00:23:39,160
Now I have combined the experience
of age with the vitality of youth!

357
00:23:39,380 --> 00:23:41,340
No one can stand before me!

358
00:23:41,540 --> 00:23:43,860
My power is sublime!

359
00:23:50,420 --> 00:23:54,740
What business does a filthy
monkey from Kano have with me?

360
00:23:54,940 --> 00:23:58,620
And pay back the debt of
honor I owe to Straw Hat.

361
00:23:58,920 --> 00:24:00,360
What a foolish ape.

362
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:03,037
Straw Hat will not
defeat the young master.

363
00:24:03,120 --> 00:24:04,880
Your honor is meaningless.

364
00:24:06,300 --> 00:24:07,940
We'll see. Ha-da!

365
00:24:11,200 --> 00:24:14,477
Listen, this kingdom
belongs to the young master.

366
00:24:14,560 --> 00:24:19,720
Therefore, all those who set foot
here are no more than his slaves.

367
00:24:25,820 --> 00:24:28,760
Your faith in Straw Hat
has ensured your death.

368
00:24:28,940 --> 00:24:30,060
I will triumph!

369
00:24:30,980 --> 00:24:34,840
And the young master's birth
cave will be your grave!

370
00:24:35,660 --> 00:24:37,360
Grave with a capital G!

371
00:24:39,560 --> 00:24:40,390
Huh?

372
00:24:40,900 --> 00:24:43,900
You're a quick little
monkey, I'll grant you that.

373
00:24:45,780 --> 00:24:48,260
However, Baby Five is ours.

374
00:24:48,600 --> 00:24:49,430
You won't...

375
00:24:49,513 --> 00:24:51,340
Take her away!

376
00:24:51,640 --> 00:24:53,200
Aw, that's so sweet!

377
00:24:53,620 --> 00:24:55,540
You wait right there, Baby Five.

378
00:24:55,740 --> 00:25:00,360
I'll protect you and pound this interloper
into the ground with a capital G!

379
00:25:01,520 --> 00:25:02,860
Oh, what should I do?

380
00:25:03,120 --> 00:25:05,377
I can't believe they're fighting over me!

381
00:25:05,460 --> 00:25:06,960
Careful! Stay back!

382
00:25:11,580 --> 00:25:13,900
You're every bit as green as I thought.

383
00:25:14,180 --> 00:25:15,277
If you had any sense,

384
00:25:15,360 --> 00:25:19,184
you would have used Baby Five as
a shield to gain the upper hand.

385
00:25:26,920 --> 00:25:29,800
Do you even realize
what Baby Five is worth?

386
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:33,377
She'd give her life in an
instant if one of us needed it.

387
00:25:33,460 --> 00:25:37,720
Why, there's scarcely a more useful
woman in the world, one might say.

388
00:25:39,820 --> 00:25:40,650
Useful?

389
00:25:43,580 --> 00:25:47,140
I'll send you to hell with
my final secret technique!

390
00:25:47,500 --> 00:25:48,440
How about this?

391
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:50,680
We'll fight for Baby Five.

392
00:25:51,520 --> 00:25:55,500
And once I win, then I'm
gonna take her as my wife!

393
00:26:04,460 --> 00:26:05,290
Whoa!

394
00:26:05,373 --> 00:26:08,200
Drill Dragon, kneel!

395
00:26:08,420 --> 00:26:09,680
Now say goodbye!

396
00:26:17,400 --> 00:26:18,520
Jeez!

397
00:26:33,460 --> 00:26:35,080
You cursed gorilla.

398
00:26:36,120 --> 00:26:37,940
Gorilla with a capital G!

399
00:26:46,760 --> 00:26:48,660
Call me the dog!

400
00:26:50,920 --> 00:26:53,957
Another battle on the second level
of the plateau comes to an end,

401
00:26:54,040 --> 00:26:55,746
with two executives defeated.

402
00:26:56,280 --> 00:26:58,300
Lao-G fell.

403
00:27:01,040 --> 00:27:02,940
Baby-Five fell.

404
00:27:03,460 --> 00:27:04,290
In love.
